  "summary": "A sealed relay heavy. It keeps pace with mediums because the missing weight is armour.",
  "lore": "WRD appears in the depot ledger beside moving substations and survey towers, not combat stores. The second seat faces a blank wall until another Aurelian machine starts nearby; then the lance net comes up without a cable or an aerial. Sixty tonnes carry a three-hundred-rated engine and less plate than the class suggests. A Warden keeps a moving line together. Alone, it is a fast heavy with nowhere safe to put the damage.",
